  "rep.departed": "Not scored: this entity is no longer registered. It was last seen in reward epoch {epoch}. A score here would read as operating badly, when the truth is that it is not operating.",
  "rep.excluded": "Deliberately not counted: delegation size, stake and fee. Size is not quality, and folding it in would tell you the biggest provider is the best one. All providers sit at the same fee floor, so fee carries no information.",
